        "id": 87509,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T15:18:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What would be really cool is if we could create mini-decks for existing Villains and plug them into the Vengeance format.Plauge Rat for example. Annex a few Plauge cards and some oneshots, house rule up a character card, then plug and play</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think someone may have already done that in the playtester forums. I think it went untested however.</p>",
