      {
        "id": 87514,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-25T05:42:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Would any Playtester care to wager a guess at where you would set (H) for conversion, since V5 don't use (H)? &nbsp;I would assume (H)=3 would give the best balance, but I could be wrong there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not sure if I can discuss this yet or not, but it is so close to the launch that I will go ahead and do so. If any big wigs have an issue with it, feel free to delete this.</p>\n<p>How I converted it was having H=2, with H-2=1. However, it is completely untesting, meaning it could very well be better to have H=3. With their HP, I went with roughly a third of what their current HP is.</p>",
